1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,810
Disappointed by chibi characters, so I made my own Gen 5 remake!

2
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:05,530
When the Gen 4 remakes were announced,

3
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:07,400
I was really, really excited.

4
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,970
But then I saw the chibi-style characters…

5
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:12,600
Honestly, I was disappointed.

6
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,020
So I started wondering:

7
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:17,370
what would a really well-made Gen 5 remake look like?

8
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:18,530
Instead of just waiting,

9
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:21,000
I decided to make it myself.

10
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,740
A DS ROM can't do 3D,

11
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:23,950
so I built it from scratch!

12
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:26,790
With Claude, in Godot 4.

13
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:29,420
At first, everything was just simple shapes.

14
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:32,920
Then I pulled the original maps and buildings out of my own Black ROM

15
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:35,370
and rebuilt them in exactly the same places.

16
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:36,740
My favorite city,

17
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:39,090
I walked around Castelia City in 3D!

18
00:00:39,210 --> 00:00:42,140
Stand in front of the Pokémon Center and your Pokémon get healed.

19
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:44,300
The original maps don't react to lighting,

20
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,930
so I wrote my own shaders for the night look.

21
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:50,130
From the fan-shaped streets to the fountain plaza,

22
00:00:50,130 --> 00:00:51,860
it's laid out exactly like the original map.

23
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:54,350
In Castelia, the camera angle changes from place to place!

24
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:56,930
On the streets you look up at the buildings from below,

25
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:58,900
and on the piers you look down from above.

26
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:01,030
At first it lagged a lot,

27
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:03,280
so I made it show only the area you're in,

28
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:07,320
cutting 366 objects down to 88.

29
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:09,990
Mode Street even has the Casteliacone stand.

30
00:01:09,990 --> 00:01:12,720
You can squeeze in with the customers in line and buy one.

31
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,350
This is the Castelia Gym.

32
00:01:14,350 --> 00:01:17,560
Someday I'd like to add the gym battle with Burgh.

33
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:20,620
Not chibi: these characters use XY proportions!

34
00:01:20,620 --> 00:01:22,290
This is the part I put the most work into.

35
00:01:22,410 --> 00:01:25,900
I brought over the original trainer models and animations from XY,

36
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:27,540
XY doesn't have Hilbert,

37
00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:30,950
so I recolored Calem in Hilbert's colors and gave him his cap.

38
00:01:31,070 --> 00:01:32,490
There's still a long way to go.

39
00:01:32,490 --> 00:01:34,320
What should I make next?

40
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:40,370
Tell me in the comments which systems or places you'd like to see!
